  triage:title "RULE-005 duplicate — connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready defined in both tests.rs and local_ipc_transport.rs" ;
  triage:description "fn connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready defined at tests.rs:116 (#[cfg(unix)]-gated) and again inside #[cfg(test)] module at local_ipc_transport.rs:1031. Same consolidation target as ARCH-001/S13-ARCH-002: move into crates/atm-daemon/src/test_support.rs; remove both inline definitions; import from test_support.rs. Note: the busy-spin pattern (yield_now loop) in this function is a separate minor finding (ATM-QA-009). Fix on feature/pS-s13-ipc-hardening; S.14 and S.15 receive via merge-forward." ;
